    <item>
      <title>Kalyan Banerjee: ‘দেখ কেমন লাগে…’, ঋতব্রত বিরোধী দলনেতার পদ খোয়াতেই ‘মজা’ লুটলেন কল্যাণ</title>
      <link>https://tv9bangla.com/india/tmc-mp-kalyan-banerjee-says-speajer-should-be-unbiased-enjoys-ritabrata-banerjees-loosing-opposition-leader-post-1364004.html</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://tv9bangla.com/india/tmc-mp-kalyan-banerjee-says-speajer-should-be-unbiased-enjoys-ritabrata-banerjees-loosing-opposition-leader-post-1364004.html</guid>
